These are hand-typed transcriptions (ground truth) of line images from the
Տօնացոյց (Tonatsoyts), Jerusalem, 1915, which is in the public domain. This
license covers the transcriptions, not the 1915 text. Lines were picked for
typing using machine readings from Calfa's models (see
data/ocr_predictions/LICENSE); the same terms are used here for consistency
with the rest of the project's published text.

When reusing this material, credit grabar-ocr (Andy Ylitalo).
